{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前のコメントで、誕生日おめでとうを伝えてなくて、遅くなったけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとちゃぁーーーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回も私の質問に答えてくれてありがとー\n髪の毛は私、今こんなに長いです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し毛先らへん切れてますが、まだ髪はながいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の質問返しで、\nナルトで一番感動したシーンは？\nTVでみたりする？\n今年のナルトの映画は見に行く？\nの質問で、一番感動したシーンは？しか答えてなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとの二つは、\nTVでも漫画も見ます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年おにぃちゃんと映画を見に行ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も見たいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンッ！\nオウチでパシャリ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわごってぃと原宿に遊びに行ったときにきたよっ！\nラフな感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊ぼうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！今日ね、\n楽屋で思ったことがあって、\nメンバー皆☆\nメンバーを誉めあっていることにきづいた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『かわいー！』\n『おしゃれー』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかいって、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっこり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも残念なことに.........自分をけなして相手を誉めるメンバーが多くて........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことないのにー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トオモイナガラ盗み聞きしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後！メンバーに言いたいことがありましてー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、地元とか帰ったら皆にお土産とかかってきてくれてありがとーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな地方の食べ物食べれて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありが豚"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の撮影の合間に、ゆきなママにミルクをもらったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅぱちゅぱ(^3^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しつもーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はロングヘアーと短いのどっちがいいかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えまってまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/8953953/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye ＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"}